to include blink detection and emotion tracking.\n- Removed hand and arm detection features for simplification.\n- Added immobility tracking and movement history for better engagement metrics.\n\nfeat(main): Improve startup logging and analytics loading\n\n- Added detailed logging during the startup process for better visibility.\n- Enhanced loading messages for various components.\n\nrefactor(test-analyzers): Clean up hand and arm detection UI elements\n\n- Removed UI elements related to hand and arm detection.\n- Introduced new indicators for head movement and speech detection.\n\nfix(test_analyzer): Increase analysis frequency for rapid movement detection\n\n- Adjusted analysis interval to allow for more frequent updates, enhancing responsiveness.\n\nupdate(user_analytics): Increment play counts and session metrics\n\n- Updated play counts and session statistics in user analytics for accuracy.","tree":{"sha":"5f035f0eda96f50d44b2e7d3d28e0a74683923ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gyxcit/imp/git/trees/5f035f0eda96f50d44b2e7d3d28e0a74683923ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gyxcit/imp/git/commits/9c6a68458efcc7bf8c74328a2135df7bbb2ccc55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180170865?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisLik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisLik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisLik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisLik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/regisLik","id":180170865,"login":"regisLik","node_id":"U_kgDOCr0wcQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisLik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisLik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisLik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://