ceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/e228117d1a7cbe4d1974ee2debe95b7c355c26c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:44:09Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:44:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: pin page filters while scrolling, fix comparison labels, upgrade majors (2.27.0) (#257)\n\n* chore(deps): upgrade vitest to 5, react-table to 9 and pwa assets generator to 2\n\n* chore(frontend): drop rimraf for a node fs clean script\n\n* chore(deps): migrate react-router-dom 7 to react-router 8\n\n* chore(deps): drop unused mangum and python-multipart, document the router 8 and vitest 5 moves\n\n* feat: pin page filters while scrolling and fix comparison labels\n\nA shared StickyToolbar keeps every page''s period, FY, sort and filter\ncontrols under the workspace header while the page scrolls, on 18 pages.\nFilter changes keep the previous rows on screen instead of swapping in a\nskeleton, so the page no longer jumps to the top. The Comparison chart\nanchors each period''s value at its own bar end, and the category table\nnames both periods once in the header instead of on every row.\n\n* chore: release 2.27.0","tree":{"sha":"75100bb7ad644c1610bcd811a077c160320f2c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/75100bb7ad644c1610bcd811a077c160320f2c85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/e228117d1a7cbe4d1974ee2debe95b7c355c26c0","verification":{"payload