","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/4fa12e4fbb3d93aa6aad402f3ea19ae3c77c0a5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:20:56Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:20:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: unify financial metrics, align schema and ship 2.26.0 (#252)\n\n* fix: unify financial metrics, align schema and close the second audit pass\n\nOne definition per metric across pages, AI tools and demo mode, with a\ncapital-loss classification flow on Data Health. Adds the\norm_schema_alignment_2026 migration (fail-closed NOT NULL tightening and\nmissing indexes), alembic check in CI, stricter request validation,\nreadable chat errors, error states before empty states, dead code\nremoval, and docs refresh. Release 2.26.0.\n\n* fix: resolve the 21 new sonarcloud findings on the pass-2 pr","tree":{"sha":"4554bdfd89de8fc2c4ad31b1e68ebe8948b236d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/4554bdfd89de8fc2c4ad31b1e68ebe8948b236d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/4fa12e4fbb3d93aa6aad402f3ea19ae3c77c0a5b","verification":{"payload":"tree 4554bdfd89de8fc2c4ad31b1e68ebe8948b236d3\nparent b683b2636082b91716828375b5a82363b8509a0f\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1790785256 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790785256 +0530\n\nfix: unify financial metrics, align schema and ship 2.26.0 (#252)\n\n* fix: unify financial metrics, align schema and close the second audit pass\n\nOne definition per metric across pages, AI tools and demo mode, with a\ncapital-loss classification flow on Data Health. Adds the\norm_schema_alignment_2026 migration (fail-closed NOT NULL tightening and\nmissing indexes), alembic check in CI, stricter request validation,\nreadable chat errors, error states before empty states, dead code\nremoval, and docs refresh. Release 2.26.0.\n\n* fix: resolve the 21 new sonarcloud findings on the pass-2 pr","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvTboCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH+8QAK2AE4aYabjt+tPCW5zVGXUg\n3/KneACEDybZRlR/Q5LhGmE51kUGVn8W0lEjBODnvwmrPi84K0jvkVh3JLgt6K+X\nu/B8ZStYFwOrs2tv4ZG0qgeEzAPisK2RpU4kLMZuc9PgTdOYohoMyV/NjXydBDD/\nuCjJFv94A0WNjbdWHCd3eKKwxguhxqIOLmMNRFt7hf6wTiWmGiYcPh1SNNWJFYMh\n/Rdp7tOeCVoa7y+H7KqFPrlzGWIQrzhK+xLkwZLrf5AWFL3RQcu3PHiZKkvcMYde\nJPkCb3c/Fh06D9Zvnq8QzZjYLYWNIMW4XggquuWOcBtx04T0e3+O+lRKU0Gz40yI\nRXEROz7mk7+dmni4+wMFIickhCDODe6q32kQx/9VwRPlDdywEkQUXIVuvKELDCCd\nheiCN8zju9CfWCoNKHsq+m8YDeBvE8WQfetjfpVp1WMngpJr6TFy7OpXFMu1qYJG\nMKuVt6M0CsIpyJweWhRSWiUvFc9kH+0fYPNFymqL5Tdbdnd2fXc0xNd+sQ4GDNbn\naE+gffbGJksgzWTnwfffNTaKdEbnryBUM1tN3mW0Fh8SHBWbqtwqOvgj5E3Hq4mM\ndJnlZEzddSUaQNqU+XK84dnPBiXEuHKMmgefCZHYEaYYj8uYDJ7Q3CdWnU5+I8dO\nUd7wqR2TIyBze9Gzj/cD\n=Eg6x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:20:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-f