api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/b683b2636082b91716828375b5a82363b8509a0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:43:31Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:43:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve the a-to-z audit and ship 2.25.0 (#251)\n\n* fix: resolve audit findings across analytics, security, finance math and page speed\n\nWave 1 of the a-to-z audit sweep: recurring edits and deletes persist,\ncapital losses stay out of spending everywhere, leap-day and IST window\nfixes, SQL aggregates for account balances and quick insights, refresh\ntoken rotation, bedrock key no longer revealed, CSP, rate limits, finance\nmath (forecast, XIRR, age of money, EPF/NPS, GST, 115BAC tax), dashboard\npaints before the ledger loads, SonarCloud cleanup and dependency bumps.\n\n* refactor: finish the audit sweep with page speed, dead code and module splits\n\nWave 2: net worth and trends read server-side daily totals, the home page\nno longer preloads recharts, preference saves skip the ledger refetch\nunless excluded accounts changed, whole-day end dates, AI tools and\ninsights honour excluded accounts and capital losses, dead modules and\nduplicate helpers removed, and every large module split below 400 lines\nwith unchanged routes and exports. Release 2.25.0 with regenerated\nrequirements.txt and a concrete changelog entry.\n\n* fix: resolve the 8 new sonarcloud issues on the audit pr","tree":{"sha":"6766a08f73c6b1e9dab3bd2e5b08d180e848426b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/6766a08f73c6b1e9dab3bd2e5b08d180e848426b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/b683b2636082b91716828375b5a82363b8509a0f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6766a08f73c6b1e9dab3bd2e5b08d180e848426b\nparent 08c9d0337933037712b2aa4c1a1688f304274ad9\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1790700211 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790700211 +0530\n\nfix: resolve the a-to-z audit and ship 2.25.0 (#251)\n\n* fix: resolve audit findings across analytics, security, finance math and page speed\n\nWave 1 of the a-to-z audit sweep: recurring edits and deletes persist,\ncapital losses stay out of spending everywhere, leap-day and IST window\nfixes, SQL aggregates for account balances and quick insights, refresh\ntoken rotation, bedrock key no longer revealed, CSP, rate limits, finance\nmath (forecast, XIRR, age of money, EPF/NPS, GST, 115BAC tax), dashboard\npaints before the ledger loads, SonarCloud cleanup and dependency bumps.\n\n* refactor: finish the audit sweep with page speed, dead code and module splits\n\nWave 2: net worth and trends read server-side daily totals, the home page\nno longer preloads recharts, preference saves skip the ledger refetch\nunless excluded accounts changed, whole-day end dates, AI tools and\ninsights honour excluded accounts and capital losses, dead modules and\nduplicate helpers removed, and every large module split below 400 lines\nwith unchanged routes and exports. Release 2.25.0 with regenerated\nrequirements.txt and a concrete changelog entry.\n\n* fix: resolve the 8 new sonarcloud issues on the audit pr","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu+qzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASNAQACwmlmlDu5S7dgiU1XoriAd2\nnqiSEodoVpKLcb+arnvyTHi8satmbI9iXc0sfjd4Jl+yJ7ly9JXRLQv5Yu24J7Di\nhxvaXuh+pM3iSjGLeiG4p2zIwFMv119rBoGO5LXFwjiiA1PWNa0kLs/yE1hgXOB5\ndf8lEm4eXr1w7FgfCmFhRlaXWuoRmb7/1B9LUNjd0GGM4a22otrswKmoWuvTPupm\nMv7/7I+Mwk6dlPTa4Y2O3eTYeMg/FV7E3drztXGFAMoo/NVA4SfiPy0MrCTVNqgy\nP/0/blC/l4XdwAHPOdckmB5FffQpueLT0kKivzvlofFgJzqp7GjIs4oVu3IL0cac\nPBNC476S0AA33G9Pyj2G20hEQhyaEgIN3gRERPh/VH2tbK98yB6jesLysHLLsLOl\nUPj67JP5ObaC3OJvdxVu7+pOajLxRF9HCVN+rYXKL8Dj