/github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/a3a0958edcda2c1e03b4e8d7e3cb30a6dcc55997/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:40:47Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:40:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: centralize financial calculations and polish workspace (#246)\n\nShare financial calculation owners across tax, dated payroll, RSUs,\ninvestments, spending, forecasts, goals, and retirement planning. Document\ntheir contracts, consumers, and focused checks in the developer guides.\n\nCorrect RSU received-share estimates, withholding timing, gross and net\nincome handling, employee deductions, mixed-income tax scope, transfer\nboundaries, balance signs, and financial-health inputs.\n\nPolish shared charts, mobile controls, dashboard priorities, planning setup,\nand recurring-payment freshness. Keep navigation responsive during lazy\nloading and honor the Full and Reduced motion preference.\n\nVerified frontend and backend suites, native PostgreSQL CI, responsive\nbrowser scenarios, production and offline flows, security checks, and zero\nopen SonarCloud PR issues. No Docker or dependency changes.","tree":{"sha":"62ce9bdefe5b3cb960ef596cec614b3b266cea36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/62ce9bdefe5b3cb960ef596cec614b3b266cea3