xYWZiZDVmMmE5YmJiMGUxMjc5MWJiYzdjYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/941041a0ac9d3c211274c0633f3cca024b93d951","sha":"941041a0ac9d3c211274c0633f3cca024b93d951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/941041a0ac9d3c211274c0633f3cca024b93d951"}],"sha":"ed078207438711afbd5f2a9bbb0e12791bbc7cbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/ed078207438711afbd5f2a9bbb0e12791bbc7cbd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/941041a0ac9d3c211274c0633f3cca024b93d951/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T05:26:14Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T05:26:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: chart monthly income vs spending and surface import history (#230)\n\nAdds a grouped bar panel of income vs spending per month to the Dashboard,\nwhich had only pie charts and so could not show direction at all. Built\nfrom the monthly aggregation the page already fetched and reduced to bare\nsparkline arrays, discarding the month keys.\n\nComplete months only, resolved through the same `completeMonthKeys` the\nMoM deltas use so the page has one definition of a finished month. The\npanel names the excluded in-progress month rather than dropping a bar\nsilently.\n\nSurfaces `import_logs` on the Upload page via `GET /api/upload/history`.\nThe table was written on every upload since the first release as the\nfile-hash idempotency record, but nothing ever read the series back.\n`imported_at` is serialized with an explicit UTC offset because the\ncolumn is naive-but-UTC.\n\nAlso fixes a pre-existing date-dependent test: the demo generator places\none-off life events by window offset, not calendar month, so a 55k-95k\ngadget splurge dominated whole-month totals and made the Oct/Nov festival\nassertion pass or fail depending on today''s date. Now scoped to the\ncategories the generator actually multiplies, verified across 28 anchor\ndates.","tree":{"sha":"c4812455237b3195b3983ea96d1d0ae273ca5d28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/c4812455237b3195b3983ea96d1d0ae273ca5d28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/941041a0ac9d3c211274c0633f3cca024b93d951","verification":{"payload":"tree c4812455237b3195b3983ea96d1d0ae273ca5d28\nparent fe27a5159d6bc2b22a81a7cd99daad52ee2982a0\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1785648374 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785648374 +0530\n\nfeat: chart monthly income vs spending and surface import history (#230)\n\nAdds a grouped bar panel of income vs spending per month to the Dashboard,\nwhich had only pie charts and so could not show direction at all. Built\nfrom the monthly aggregation the page already fetched and reduced to bare\nsparkline arrays, discarding the month keys.\n\nComplete months only, resolved through the same `completeMonthKeys` the\nMoM deltas use so the page has one definition of a finished month. The\npanel names the excluded in-progress month rather than dropping a bar\nsilently.\n\nSurfaces `import_logs` on the Upload page via `GET /api/upload/history`.\nThe table was written on every upload since the first release as the\nfile-hash idempotency record, but nothing ever read the series back.\n`imported_at` is serialized with an explicit UTC offset because the\ncolumn is naive-but-UTC.\n\nAlso fixes a pre-existing date-dependent test: the demo generator places\none-off life events by window offset, not calendar month, so a 55k-95k\ngadget splurge dominated whole-month totals and made the Oct/Nov festival\nassertion pass or fail depending on today''s date. Now scoped to the\ncategories the generator actually multiplies, verified across 28 anchor\ndates.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbtT2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAMgQAJVOVKjN/yv16fAoRwPwclM+\nQStUEqZcwiUP5obRUztuSBgKmgzi4Akm9ekGV9QMQBGUmtBrPxWN4xa8zfspc62V\nhUdNvEWD9bH5WLffL43JgT6CakMPY5BgPJE3mwmVriIrvFe/G/P6dp9fTaXanzI/\nb+UUatjfK0nE4T3lbVRxOSCS31XjotJCIYWfsjH3eqwF9mzoAgfD/8aBxyBGzPwz\n09luS+sHZYaW+l6kN/FwopA+8+Wqmz0qsU/NbbCO1mcgyRB6sDk1LRsiE0sbfAg1\nJLLezcP+iNnA4bzsfxHcc4+qaoJfGgtjXYw0qgQrcTsnPVtE/paYH8jpaoQneRKL\nTC1nnIaEjV6zRpiwhM35rpcQpQ4wjP9Pf8ODvYy1qdlBfQfH0tk+VI246reN0dfF\ngY/t5I+G5OUmqqz2dP34bkz6efUAGLOWQtLysLp+aoKQEVQEZOVXQ05Jcqri9Tmj\nP3DtCksHIeaWW1mPJHJwBBHwArD3ZRaAVjd1mCt5s04Rh+ZfLnlU9jHvqZAbP58k\n/lGbj8zmYqA8mxxNzCTcKCURIv/MGLtOblr+y/4CaruX33Usz1ZOxO+gmBAQIQZf\nx+TfCuZKtxixrdJeyGDPA5RurOgqouHzgfFlniUit9Jratq/S8P3SU+WkqYMvFU0\nETjDlrJldXc6wLgLr1cP\n=hpA5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-02T05:26:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://a