a16/ledger-sync/commits/7535b16739e64bb7c083c0d96793c4aaedbc1076/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:14:42Z","email":"29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"renovate[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T03:14:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): replace dependency framer-motion with motion ^12.42.2 (#220)\n\n* fix(deps): replace dependency framer-motion with motion ^12.42.2\n\n* fix(deps): point imports at motion/react after framer-motion replacement\n\nRenovate swapped the framer-motion package for motion but left 125 import\nsites pointing at the old specifier, so four test files failed to resolve and\nthe build was broken. motion exposes the React bindings under motion/react.\n\nAlso widens the vite manualChunks pattern so the animation library still lands\nin vendor-motion, and updates the doc comments that named the old package.\n\nVerified: 338 tests pass (was 319 with 4 files erroring), lint clean, tsc\nclean, build succeeds with vendor-motion emitted.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"27d5b6367cf4d872330b0f01c926308d1d9625d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/27d5b6367cf4d872330b0f01c926308d1d9625d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/7535b16739e64bb7c083c0d96793c4aaedbc1076","verification":{"payload":"tree 27d5b6367cf4d872330b0f01c926308d1d9625d0\nparent b0cb33132600b2faadb22b9b80c5d4a74797451c\nauthor renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1784949282 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784949282 +0530\n\nfix(deps): replace dependency framer-motion with motion ^12.42.2 (#220)\n\n* fix(deps): replace dependency framer-motion with motion ^12.42.2\n\n* fix(deps): point imports at motion/react after framer-motion replacement\n\nRenovate swapped the framer-motion package for motion but left 125 import\nsites pointing at the old specifier, so four test files failed to resolve and\nthe build was broken. motion exposes the React bindings under motion/react.\n\nAlso widens the vite manualChunks pattern so the animation library still lands\nin vendor-motion, and updates the doc comments that named the old package.\n\nVerified: 338 tests pass (was 319 with 4 files erroring), lint clean, tsc\nclean, build succeeds with vendor-motion emitted.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZCoiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0PkQAHhjYp091gfsPyTguwPyNRgo\nxlfhNaXBS4OFNOLICbSK6KZgrbuPRdAagA90CL2P69QkTaJFYanyNzc7LqGuuU2K\nwoSDpeCRQPPWcg4aIvQlfI5bZOr+StJU3B9TW9iZc68zolQkGYroCgYBLQKxx4XY\n0NaIvh3JVoBC40otSuOCRqB7ao3BDyuJ5ZvfT5GVtqYDQ0/PQvYyj3E8oHcIjf5N\nF+lmkDRuZAp7Yrs8fzwejUpIRJXcVSgNZgRVhsh/ibOq49+/j43Q1OA+nLDJvvhh\n62q0fMFeQ1Tcvg3uhKxFXj7k4KToPSgmD25dfQ7Kt4pyxQpqcLEpVoNt+PXZDROA\nzPDxLba7US/6x6FfK6Px0fyjbVNMS9kO51iqorwwxbMie4vJz166T9H0/BaFpM6F\nXCRgJZ4r2kpbyXoI2MeOLZAHMeJaM+dBlbpFlJSv9Y09cPlKN0u2IsXlMiXN6/Ot\nFcHraFn3B6J3feveOqNM43XVORjHZXESuVTzI4b31gjFqK9bUCcg6ket0FPGi/VS\nNHHemUafr0QOo0xjb4r2GdGASsWW5JRLKN2tjTd+MnN76kETkcR7uvamjDMYEUWS\n9wo6UzKqS1cHVR/7TiHaK1p1x/PQu+izRTzecrnTNNiaCd03wdfbsSbeHJXckdmK\nrIJPKMbU6uNvgBl71ZLq\n=en+e\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T03:14:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"