ed bars (focus\n  one, fade the rest to 0.35) -- the same isolation affordance the pie\n  chart already uses. Gated to bars.length===1 && !stacked so grouped/\n  stacked charts (where index-dimming would fade unrelated series) are\n  untouched.\n- Chart tooltip box now glides to follow the cursor (transform/opacity\n  transition on the wrapper + recharts tooltip reposition animation)\n  instead of teleporting between points. Applied to every chart at once\n  via the shared chartTooltipProps.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNZCtT/y+88jxq/d/plBH+UEFRairYJ+r/TbwT8uhHAeJ0OTKhwdM4ggB+r7nA83Gm\nM6JCAYvTXvErvBEwn4fQA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-22T09:56:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/f9bf103e7caa2a18cb72ccbd43ab11d7963ca8c4","node_id":"C_kwDOQ2vxg9o