 and closed:\n\n- Landing page: FeaturesSection cards and WhatIsSection workflows now\n  reveal on scroll (whileInView stagger; slide-in rows; snapshot panel\n  section reveal) -- the only page with zero motion.\n- Mutual-fund Returns Analysis stats (Total Return, XIRR, Effective\n  Value) count up via the shared format-preserving hook.\n\nEverything else verified already animated: 24/27 pages get PAGE_ENTER\nvia PageContainer (DemoEntry/OAuthCallback are sub-second redirect\nscreens, intentionally instant); all 17 hand-rolled recharts files have\nper-series draw-ins (isAnimationActive via shouldAnimate); the 6\nisAnimationActive={false} cases are deliberate (forecast cones and\nprojection bands sharing a stack with an animating series would tear).","tree":{"sha":"77fd81d2c555a7dd55550561b7838e5fd4e44dcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/77fd81d2c555a7dd55550561b7838e5fd4e44dcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/3b1e45c24410b7d11d3edee0947f553632fedd2d","verification":{"payload":"tree 77fd81d2c555a7dd55550561b7838e5fd4e44dcf\nparent 5997eeae939ebf9cbec3a1100cb123fb0d1b7818\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784711810 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784711810 +0530\n\nfeat(ui): close motion gaps found by full page/chart enumeration\n\nEnumerated all 27 pages and all 21 chart-bearing files to verify motion\ncoverage; three gaps found and closed:\n\n- Landing page: FeaturesSection cards and WhatIsSection workflows now\n  reveal on scroll (whileInView stagger; slide-in rows; snapshot panel\n  section reveal) -- the only page with zero motion.\n- Mutual-fund Returns Analysis stats (Total Return, XIRR, Effective\n  Value) count up via the shared format-preserving hook.\n\nEverything else verified already animated: 24/27 pages get PAGE_ENTER\nvia PageContainer (DemoEntry/OAuthCallback are sub-second redirect\nscreens, intentionally instant); all 17 hand-rolled recharts fil