"email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"fix(ui): replace backtracking regexes with linear scans in value parser\n\nSonar S8786 x3: the \\D*/[\\d,]+ parse regex and the (\\d{3})+ lookahead\ngrouping regexes have super-linear backtracking. Replaced with manual\nlinear scans (first-digit prefix split, right-to-left comma grouping).\nSame behavior -- all 7 round-trip tests unchanged and green.","tree":{"sha":"dcae083bfa50e689269ebe3b51932c0655676d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/dcae083bfa50e689269ebe3b51932c0655676d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/fda761ddb3799e2a401b4f134a61da66db49d611","verification":{"payload":"tree dcae083bfa50e689269ebe3b51932c0655676d8e\nparent 8324d25e96ddda64e0edd76bb0148a5394da811d\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784710253 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784710253 +0530\n\nfix(ui): replace backtracking regexes with linear scans in value parser\n\nSonar S8786 x3: the \\D*/[\\d,]+ parse regex and the (\\d{3})+ lookahead\ngrouping regexes have super-linear backtracking. Replaced with manual\nlinear scans (first-digit prefix split, right-to-left comma grouping).\nSame behavior -- all 7 round-trip tests unchanged and green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDt5Ev92XLuLM9dgGWd1rN43tnOZTOA43zQMw/Ftr+O5bbRqoxlpSWP/SHhOVScVGR\nTeWws+w408uByrA5ya1AE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-22T08:51:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_u