b.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/efcfd20f6e8b5c35d9d16e1cf1356ddaed24f929/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:51:32Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:51:32Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"fix(analytics): score financial health from real account balances\n\nFinHealth and CFP cards derived liquid assets as a flow proxy\n(cumulative income - expenses - net investments), which clamps to 0\nwhenever lifetime investing exceeds the lifetime cash surplus. Users\nwith real bank balances saw Emergency Fund 0 months and Liquidity 0 mo.\n\n- add computeBalancePosition: liquid = current bank/cash/wallet balances,\n  investments valued separately, liabilities from negative balances\n- feed real balances into emergency-fund, liquidity, and solvency ratios\n  (fall back to the flow proxy only when no balance feed is attached)\n- score emergency fund against total monthly living expenses, per FHN/CFSI\n- recency-weight income and savings CV so old lean months do not flag a\n  now-steady earner as volatile; widen income-stability bands (median\n  household CV ~38% is normal, not volatile)\n- align debt-service tiers to the 36/43% banking standard\n- count-up score headers, staggered card reveals, spring bars\n- 11 new unit tests for the balance position, weighted CV, and ratios","tree":{"sha":"0f2ce6d92aa79d5301d690f6c0f9a53c2f6069ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/0f2ce6d92aa79d5301d690f6c0f9a53c2f6069ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/efcfd20f6e8b5c35d9d16e1cf1356ddaed24f929","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f2ce6d92aa79d5301d690f6c0f9a53c2f6069ae\nparent f972169ee4cbce4e0318a402627b5fc4100bf2cf\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784659892 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784659892 +0530\n\nfix(analytics): score financial health from real account balances\n\nFinHealth and CFP cards derived liquid assets as a flow proxy\n(cumulative income - expenses - net investments), which clamps to 0\nwhenever lifetime investing exceeds the lifetime cash surplus. Users\nwith real bank balances saw Emergency Fund 0 months and Liquidity 0 mo.\n\n- add computeBalancePosition: liquid = current bank/cash/wallet balances,\n  investments valued separately, liabilities from negative balances\n- feed real balances into emergency-fund, liquidity, and solvency ratios\n  (fall back to the flow proxy only when no balance feed is attached)\n- score emergency fund against total monthly living expenses, per FHN/CFSI\n- recency-weight income and savings CV so old lean months do not flag a\n  now-steady earner as volatile; widen income-stability bands (median\n  household CV ~38% is normal, not volatile)\n- align debt-service tiers to the 36/43% banking standard\n- count-up score headers, staggered card reveals, spring bars\n- 11 new unit tests for the balance position, weighted CV, and ratios\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDdrrO11uXOqJ1Wm706O84L5s04gwFqWQhOoPVlQnDbpjqI2wLf/zQH8OP4L263w4A\nd6DaLwL9abhORHnl427QI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T18:52:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_k