766bc097255ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/7781d21ea2e26cc40aebb4a9f287633bc4dceed3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:00:40Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T11:00:40Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"feat(chat): assistant empty state with greeting and quick-action chips\n\nIdeation from modern assistant panels (FlowAI-style reference): a\nfriendly first-open experience instead of a bare one-liner.\n\n- centered sparkles mark on the workspace grid texture\n- \"Hey there!\" greeting + capability blurb that sets expectations\n  honestly (answers use the user''s real ledger numbers via tools)\n- three icon-led quick-action chips (ledger-control surface), each\n  wired to a full finance prompt: spending breakdown, recurring-bill\n  review, savings-health check -- replacing the plain text links\n- chips reuse existing tokens/surfaces; no new colors or spacing\n\nComponent tests: greeting + chips render, chip click sends its full\nprompt, empty-input Send explains itself. (Widget is auth-gated, so\ntests are the verification path; jsdom scrollTo stubbed.)","tree":{"sha":"48244f8b0972003c772a84d57f12a20edeb2ea30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/48244f8b0972003c772a84d57f12a20edeb2ea30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/7781d21ea2e26cc40aebb4a9f287633bc4dceed3","verification":{"payload":"tree 48244f8b0972003c772a84d57f12a20edeb2ea30\nparent f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784113240 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784113240 +0530\n\nfeat(chat): assistant empty state with greeting and quick-action chips\n\nIdeation from modern assistant panels (FlowAI-style reference): a\nfriendly first-open experience instead of a bare one-liner.\n\n- centered sparkles mark on the workspace grid texture\n- \"Hey there!\" greeting + capability blurb that sets expectations\n  honestly (answers use the user''s real ledger numbers via tools)\n- three icon-led quick-action chips (ledger-control surface), each\n  wired to a full finance prompt: spending breakdown, recurring-bill\n  review, savings-health check -- replacing the plain text links\n- chips reuse existing tokens/surfaces; no new colors or spacing\n\nComponent tests: greeting + chips render, chip click sends its full\nprompt, empty-input Send explains itself. (Widget is auth-gated, so\ntests are the verification path; jsdom scrollTo stubbed.)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP/Rv0pZgW/ykUDX1tvHhn9ppskteemwcepO/HeA3vLb+kM1ib2fB/SvSr/oCmRbkO\nK4dlpaIbeNSkYSGcMg/gw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T11:01:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/7781d21ea2e26cc40aebb4a9f287633bc4dceed3","node_id":"C_kwDOQ2vxg9oAKDc3ODFkMjFlYTJlMjZjYzQwYWViYjRhOWYyODc2MzNiYzRkY2VlZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1","sha":"f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1"}],"sha":"7781d21ea2e26cc40aebb4a9f287633bc4dceed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/7781d21ea2e26cc40aebb4a9f287633bc4dceed3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T10:42:53Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T10:42:53Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"fix(ui): chart click-selection, hover consistency, missing hover info\n\nChart \"stays selected\" bug (reproduced live): clicking or drag-scrubbing\nacross a Recharts chart selected the SVG tick/label text and painted the\nbrowser''s blue selection overlay, which read as the chart being stuck\nselected until clicking elsewhere. Charts are now select-none via a\n.recharts-wrapper override (+ the scrub-interactive Sparkline SVG).\nVerified: the drag repro that previously selected \"Jul 24\" now selects\nnothing, and tooltips still hide on mouse leave.\n\nHover info (hunt findings, each verified in code):\n- SummaryCard / transaction note cells (desktop + mobile cards) /\n  RecurringCard name / SavedViewsMenu entries: truncated text now\n  carries title= to reveal the full value\n- sidebar sign-out, TagEditor trigger, DemoBanner close, chat\n  Send/Stop: icon buttons gain title tooltips (Send explains why\n  disabled when input is empty)\n- AnalyticsTimeFilter prev/next: disabled state now explains \"already\n  at your earliest/latest data\"\n- MetricCard: new optional titleInfo prop for computed metrics; wired\n  for Cashflow XIRR (\"annualized return implied by deposit/withdrawal\n  timing, book value\")\n\nHover consistency:\n- BucketCard / comparison KpiCard / settings drag chips: whileHover\n  without whileTap left cards stuck lifted after tap on touch; added\n  whileTap resets\n- Returns-analysis holdings chart: tooltip cursor now uses the shared\n  chartTooltipProps cursor instead of a one-off grid fill","tree":{"sha":"ad7831e0913a4e280d075d70e7262686f5e3306a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/ad7831e0913a4e280d075d70e7262686f5e3306a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1","verification":{"payload":"tree ad7831e0913a4e280d075d70e7262686f5e3306a\nparent df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784112173 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784112173 +0530\n\nfix(ui): chart click-selection, hover consistency, missing hover info\n\nChart \"stays selected\" bug (reproduced live): clicking or drag-scrubbing\nacross a Recharts chart selected the SVG tick/label text and painted the\nbrowser''s blue selection overlay, which read as the chart being stuck\nselected until clicking elsewhere. Charts are now select-none via a\n.recharts-wrapper override (+ the scrub-interactive Sparkline SVG).\nVerified: the drag repro that previously selected \"Jul 24\" now selects\nnothing, and tooltips still hide on mouse leave.\n\nHover info (hunt findings, each verified in code):\n- SummaryCard / transaction note cells (desktop + mobile cards) /\n  RecurringCard name / SavedViewsMenu entries: truncated text now\n  carries title= to reveal the full value\n- sidebar sign-out, TagEditor trigger, DemoBanner close, chat\n  Send/Stop: icon buttons gain title tooltips (Send explains why\n  disabled when input is empty)\n- AnalyticsTimeFilter prev/next: disabled state now explains \"already\n  at your earliest/latest data\"\n- MetricCard: new optional titleInfo prop for computed metrics; wired\n  for Cashflow XIRR (\"annualized return implied by deposit/withdrawal\n  timing, book value\")\n\nHover consistency:\n- BucketCard / comparison KpiCard / settings drag chips: whileHover\n  without whileTap left cards stuck lifted after tap on touch; added\n  whileTap resets\n- Returns-analysis holdings chart: tooltip cursor now uses the shared\n  chartTooltipProps cursor instead of a one-off grid fill\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBx5+0fkqCdwpvC9av9BCr1YYaOjcibwTo6yEfpPVP2qWQVq2eT+zdjuA3Ns3e95KO\nVd+y/OPTB/sugrc4f8Mgo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T10:43:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1","node_id":"C_kwDOQ2vxg9oAKGYzNjY0MzZmMGMwMzc0OGVlYTI2ZTlmOTI2YTI2ZTEyN2YxYjVmYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c","sha":"df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c"}],"sha":"f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/f366436f0c03748eea26e9f926a26e127f1b5fc1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:49:42Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:49:42Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"fix(theme): kill the last theme-blind color literals\n\nConsistency sweep found four spots bypassing the token system -- all\nfrozen at the OLD dark-palette values, so they silently drifted from\nthe current accents and ignored the light theme entirely:\n\n- TaxSummaryGrid progress bands: hardcoded rgba of the old green/\n  orange/red -> hexToRgba(rawColors.*) so bands track the live palette\n  in both themes\n- Sparkline hover-dot ring: hardcoded black -> var(--app-bg) so the\n  dot reads as cut-out on light AND dark cards\n- Input/Select error focus ring: hardcoded old-red rgba -> new\n  --focus-ring-error(-soft) tokens with per-theme red values\n\nSpacing/radius audit came back clean: gap/padding usage clusters on\nthe 4px scale and radius tiers map to component roles (2xl cards, xl\ntiles, lg controls) -- no fixes needed there.","tree":{"sha":"bcfdc56e1a4f99ac91fa1fecae87b7618cd16324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/bcfdc56e1a4f99ac91fa1fecae87b7618cd16324"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c","verification":{"payload":"tree bcfdc56e1a4f99ac91fa1fecae87b7618cd16324\nparent 1c1005a9807a8184e4c8df44384fb9471af14f68\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784105382 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784105382 +0530\n\nfix(theme): kill the last theme-blind color literals\n\nConsistency sweep found four spots bypassing the token system -- all\nfrozen at the OLD dark-palette values, so they silently drifted from\nthe current accents and ignored the light theme entirely:\n\n- TaxSummaryGrid progress bands: hardcoded rgba of the old green/\n  orange/red -> hexToRgba(rawColors.*) so bands track the live palette\n  in both themes\n- Sparkline hover-dot ring: hardcoded black -> var(--app-bg) so the\n  dot reads as cut-out on light AND dark cards\n- Input/Select error focus ring: hardcoded old-red rgba -> new\n  --focus-ring-error(-soft) tokens with per-theme red values\n\nSpacing/radius audit came back clean: gap/padding usage clusters on\nthe 4px scale and radius tiers map to component roles (2xl cards, xl\ntiles, lg controls) -- no fixes needed there.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQI+vBpfXFVzyEOSNU8ehLfPuENTa5PNcJfYbd+ZKOjLRq/0QmSXwkXGvgg0RYGl9ZY\nYFFQ910MupO/2c8eVakgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T08:50:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c","node_id":"C_kwDOQ2vxg9oAKGRmODM2MjUzOWRkMTcxN2EwYWQwY2I4NDFhYjVjZWUyMDViMmUzNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/1c1005a9807a8184e4c8df44384fb9471af14f68","sha":"1c1005a9807a8184e4c8df44384fb9471af14f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/1c1005a9807a8184e4c8df44384fb9471af14f68"}],"sha":"df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/df8362539dd1717a0ad0cb841ab5cee205b2e35c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/1c1005a9807a8184e4c8df44384fb9471af14f68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:37:16Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:37:16Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"feat(theme): widen the tonal ladder so surfaces lift off the page\n\nThe flat \"monotonous\" look came from page and cards sitting within ~2%\nluminance of each other in both themes. Widened the contrast between\ntiers -- tokens only:\n\nDark: page #05080d -> #0a0f16 (rich navy, not void black); surface\nladder lifted a full tone (#1c2430 base at higher alpha) so cards read\nas raised panels; nav/sidebar/header re-tuned between page and card.\n\nLight: page #f5f8fc -> #eaf0f7 (a real blue-grey, Radix blue2-3\nlineage) so pure-white cards visibly float; surface tiers re-spread\n(#f8fafd -> #dde6f0) and glass shadows slightly strengthened to match\nthe deeper page. PWA manifest synced.\n\nVerified live in both themes: dark reads as layered navy panels, light\nas white cards floating on cool grey. 301 tests, tsc, eslint green.","tree":{"sha":"be9c4b220259a5de1d8e56907980448ef46676ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/be9c4b220259a5de1d8e56907980448ef46676ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/1c1005a9807a8184e4c8df44384fb9471af14f68","verification":{"payload":"tree be9c4b220259a5de1d8e56907980448ef46676ab\nparent fcb22d183beb304017a9ff34c73b48c4b628a348\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784104636 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784104636 +0530\n\nfeat(theme): widen the tonal ladder so surfaces lift off the page\n\nThe flat \"monotonous\" look came from page and cards sitting within ~2%\nluminance of each other in both themes. Widened the contrast between\ntiers -- tokens only:\n\nDark: page #05080d -> #0a0f16 (rich navy, not void black); surface\nladder lifted a full tone (#1c2430 base at higher alpha) so cards read\nas raised panels; nav/sidebar/header re-tuned between page and card.\n\nLight: page #f5f8fc -> #eaf0f7 (a real blue-grey, Radix blue2-3\nlineage) so pure-white cards visibly float; surface tiers re-spread\n(#f8fafd -> #dde6f0) and glass shadows slightly strengthened to match\nthe deeper page. PWA manifest synced.\n\nVerified live in both themes: dark reads as layered navy panels, light\nas white cards floating on cool grey. 301 tests, tsc, eslint green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP/NCPrlEN0dO3gqQijiAE69PDuGg362mtSuSRI+oJ7gKvXiTUI6ruWnVrp8pfclNk\naON4wU6x4cd1Vld0f5/A0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-