gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/fcb22d183beb304017a9ff34c73b48c4b628a348/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:29:25Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T08:29:25Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"feat(home): drop the hero dashboard screenshot\n\nRemove the static dashboard PNG block from the landing hero -- the\nscreenshot went stale on every UI change (it still showed the old\ntheme) and cost ~1.4MB of eager-loaded, high-fetch-priority images on\nfirst paint. The highlights strip moves up to sit directly under the\nCTAs (border-t restored since it no longer follows the image frame).\nBoth PNG assets deleted; \"Explore demo\" remains the real product tour.","tree":{"sha":"736671b525a089ac5fcca79ef18bfdc3a217823e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/736671b525a089ac5fcca79ef18bfdc3a217823e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/fcb22d183beb304017a9ff34c73b48c4b628a348","verification":{"payload":"tree 736671b525a089ac5fcca79ef18bfdc3a217823e\nparent 6a62912b18a002715811337ae7df81339a215c99\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784104165 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784104165 +0530\n\nfeat(home): drop the hero dashboard