cool-cast NEUTRALS, not louder accents:\n\nDark theme:\n- background #000 -> #05080d; surfaces remapped from neutral grey to\n  hue-215 blue-greys (Radix blue-dark 1-2 lineage: #151b24/#1f2733)\n- primary blue #4a9eff -> #3b9eff, vibrant #0a84ff -> #0090ff (Radix\n  blue-dark 10/9, tuned for dark surfaces)\n- text ladder, sidebar, header, grid band, focus ring re-cast cool\n\nLight theme:\n- warm greige (#f7f7f5 / #171918 ink) -> cool blue-white (#f5f8fc,\n  Radix blue1/2 lineage) with blue-grey surface tiers and ink text\n- borders/shadows/scrollbars re-cast from warm ink to blue-ink\n- accents unchanged (#2563eb already AA on white)\n\nOne-place-controls-all: only tokens changed; components read tokens.\nrawColors fallbacks + chart brush fill + PWA manifest colors synced to\nmatch. Verified live in both themes (computed --color-background /\n--color-app-blue checked, dashboards screenshotted).","tree":{"sha":"4c570cff8408eaecd529eb5625fa54e6b2cf95e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/4c570cff8408eaecd529eb5625fa54e6b2cf95e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/6a62912b18a002715811337ae7df81339a215c99","verification":{"payload":"tree 4c570cff8408eaecd529eb5625fa54e6b2cf95e2\nparent bf1801ab301278fdb506462e413b52ef03eb3314\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784103322 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784103322 +0530\n\nfeat(theme): bluish color refresh grounded in Radix blue scales\n\nResearch pass (Radix Colors blue/indigo scales, Stripe''s perceptual-\ncontrast method, Tailwind v4 oklch ramps) concluded the \"bluish\nfintech\" look comes from cool-cast NEUTRALS, not louder accents:\n\nDark theme:\n- background #000 -> #05080d; surfaces remapped from neutral grey to\n  hue-215 blue-greys (Radix blue-dark 1-2 lineage: #151b24/#1f2733)\n- primary blue #4a9eff -> #3b9eff, vibrant #0a84ff -> #0090ff (Radix\n  blue-dark 10/9, tuned for dark surfaces)\n- text ladder, sidebar, header, grid band, focus ring re-cast cool\n\nLight theme:\n- warm greige (#f7f7f5 / #171918 ink) -> cool blue-white (#f5f8fc,\n  Radix blue1/2 lineage) with blue-grey surface tiers and ink text\n- borders/shadows/scrollbars re-cast from warm ink to blue-ink\n- accents unchanged (#2563eb already AA on white)\n\nOne-place-controls-all: only tokens changed; components read tokens.\nrawColors fallbacks + chart brush fill + PWA manifest colors synced to\nmatch. Verified live in both themes (computed --color-background /\n--color-app-blue checked, dashboards screenshotted).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGGJeW8wGKArcYRVplbQ4D17l+KZxrzCKr5Y3AWDeSPMG8DRnvvTDiReeT4WVuCdRt\nUucxatD+5ky5kM4xxDewQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T08:15:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledge