NmM0Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/c2a38d2dac3db53478f68d8718a1e68b54ff2c3c","sha":"c2a38d2dac3db53478f68d8718a1e68b54ff2c3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/c2a38d2dac3db53478f68d8718a1e68b54ff2c3c"}],"sha":"4d62197bdd0b2e9ca6eecd92739e70a4b8d6c4b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/4d62197bdd0b2e9ca6eecd92739e70a4b8d6c4b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/c2a38d2dac3db53478f68d8718a1e68b54ff2c3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:28:19Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T06:28:19Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"feat(demo): 48-month realistic ledger with full feature coverage\n\nDemo data was 24 flat months with a linear salary and no coverage for\nhalf the feature surfaces. Rebuilt on India-grounded curves and wired\nevery computed-read endpoint so all 24 pages render real data in demo.\n\nRealism (sources noted inline):\n- salary compounds via April appraisals (~9.5%/yr, India increment\n  surveys) plus one 18% promotion; net ~1.18L -> ~1.7L over 4 years\n- expenses ride a 4.4%/yr CPI curve (Cost Inflation Index 331->376);\n  rent steps ~8% per 11-month lease renewal\n- SIP steps up yearly (12k -> ~17k); PPF fills more of the 80C ceiling\n  as salary grows; interest income scales with the corpus\n- Oct/Nov festival season: 1.35x spend + more purchases in gift-heavy\n  categories, festival bonus, shagun income; annual vacation cluster,\n  yearly gadget splurge, one medical event, wedding-season gifts, and a\n  12-month no-cost EMI stream (bill calendar / commitments fodder)\n\nCoverage (new demoComputedReads.ts + adapter wiring in client.ts):\n- facets + paginated /transactions/search (tags, filters, amounts)\n- quick-insights, data-date-range, category-monthly-history,\n  category-daily-series, cohort-spending, daily-summaries\n- transfer-flows, merchant-intelligence, investment-holdings computed\n  from the ledger; 50/30/20 spending-rule computed instead of zeroed\n- all v2 endpoints answered by the adapter with non-default params\n  (previously fell through to {data: []} whenever a page passed params)\n- saved views (3 presets), account classifications, sparse user tags\n  (#festival / #weekend-treat / #office)\n- 4-FY salary structure matching the ledger; recurring list gains the\n  annual insurance premium and a completed EMI stream\n\n10 new generator tests: determinism, 48-month span, appraisal growth,\nlease-step rent, festival uplift, savings-rate band, life-event\nstreams, tags, CC bill-payment invariant.","tree":{"sha":"fe9cb3c0d360e8cd35e808677809faf7316c508f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/fe9cb3c0d360e8cd35e808677809faf7316c508f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/c2a38d2dac3db53478f68d8718a1e68b54ff2c3c","verification":{"payload":"tree fe9cb3c0d360e8cd35e808677809faf7316c508f\nparent 33598a8543692b10d484e186e600dac9b1f1016c\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784096899 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1784096899 +0530\n\nfeat(demo): 48-month realistic ledger with full feature coverage\n\nDemo data was 24 flat months with a linear salary and no coverage for\nhalf the feature surfaces. Rebuilt on India-grounded curves and wired\nevery computed-read endpoint so all 24 pages render real data in demo.\n\nRealism (sources noted inline):\n- salary compounds via April appraisals (~9.5%/yr, India increment\n  surveys) plus one 18% promotion; net ~1.18L -> ~1.7L over 4 years\n- expenses ride a 4.4%/yr CPI curve (Cost Inflation Index 331->376);\n  rent steps ~8% per 11-month lease renewal\n- SIP steps up yearly (12k -> ~17k); PPF fills more of the 80C ceiling\n  as salary grows; interest income scales with the corpus\n- Oct/Nov festival season: 1.35x spend + more purchases in gift-heavy\n  categories, festival bonus, shagun income; annual vacation cluster,\n  yearly gadget splurge, one medical event, wedding-season gifts, and a\n  12-month no-cost EMI stream (bill calendar / commitments fodder)\n\nCoverage (new demoComputedReads.ts + adapter wiring in client.ts):\n- facets + paginated /transactions/search (tags, filters, amounts)\n- quick-insights, data-date-range, category-monthly-history,\n  category-daily-series, cohort-spending, daily-summaries\n- transfer-flows, merchant-intelligence, investment-holdings computed\n  from the ledger; 50/30/20 spending-rule computed instead of zeroed\n- all v2 endpoints answered by the adapter with non-default params\n  (previously fell through to {data: []} whenever a page passed params)\n- saved views (3 presets), account classifications, sparse user tags\n  (#festival / #weekend-treat / #office)\n- 4-FY salary structure matching the ledger; recurring list gains the\n  annual insurance premium and a completed EMI stream\n\n10 new generator tests: determinism, 48-month span, appraisal growth,\nlease-step rent, festival uplift, savings-rate band, life-event\nstreams, tags, CC bill-payment invariant.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEtDgz+IfzHgm+G8XVPh8MNl9idD5WQiXtkOaCHa4J4FJwiCBBIEf/koqe7VVVYGKM\nxNW6b8NyAeKDyvCNoxgwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T06:29:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/c2a38d2dac3db53478f68d8718a1e68b54ff2c3c","node_id":"C_kwDOQ2vxg9oAKGMyYTM4ZDJkYWMzZGI1MzQ3OGY2OGQ4NzE4YTFlNjhiNTRmZjJjM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/33598a8543692b10d484e186e600dac9b1f1016c","sha":"33598a8543692b10d484e186e600dac9b1f1016c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/33598a8