om/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/6c1c3735213346694174202ad2217fecb16b77c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T14:08:25Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T14:08:25Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"feat(net-worth): seed milestone ladder with early rungs (50k, 1L, 2L)\n\nPrepend ₹50k, ₹1L, ₹2L before the ₹5L-multiples ladder so a new saver\ngets frequent early wins instead of waiting until ₹5L for the first\nmilestone. Ladder jumps ₹2L -> ₹5L (no ₹3L/₹4L), then ₹5L steps as before.\n\n- formatMilestoneLabel renders sub-lakh values as thousands (₹50k, not ₹0.5L)\n- empty-state copy updated to \"first milestone (₹50k ...)\"\n- tests: ₹50k label, early-rung ladder shape, achieved set for a ₹22L anchor","tree":{"sha":"5a38032e1f61ca1c15eeb843d3adbb3ea37ecffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/5a38032e1f61ca1c15eeb843d3adbb3ea37ecffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/6c1c3735213346694174202ad2217fecb16b77c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a38032e1f61ca1c15eeb843d3adbb3ea37ecffc\nparent d69cc85f20b2d4ef5a8124e44d6d3da5a9afcb89\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1783865305 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1783865305 +0530\n\nfeat(net-worth): seed milestone ladder with early rungs (50k, 1L, 2L)\n\nPrepend ₹50k, ₹1L, ₹2L before the ₹5L-multiples ladder so a new saver\ngets frequent early wins instead of waiting until ₹5L for the first\nmilestone. Ladder jumps ₹2L -> ₹5L (no ₹3L/₹4L), then ₹5L steps as before.\n\n- formatMilestoneLabel renders sub-lakh values as thousands (₹50k, not ₹0.5L)\n- empty-state copy updated to \"first milestone (₹50k ...)\"\n- tests: ₹50k label, early-rung ladder shape, achieved set for a ₹22L anchor\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKcbcslURjMj7rS6qb9TEAbglWKobEML8lp0wi5oaM0oni5UHOAzOtXESpDT0h/FxX\nEbdn+iqIb8O6Kd4MmwAgo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T14:09:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commit/6c1c3735213346694174