,{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/commits/9b0f5575cd70026ff51469c3c5eadb254f13d772/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T07:03:49Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T07:03:49Z","email":"sg85207@gmail.com","name":"Sagar Gupta"},"message":"fix(hooks): include limit/offset in analyticsV2 query keys\n\nEight useAnalyticsV2 hooks sent limit/offset to the API but omitted them\nfrom the queryKey. With staleTime: Infinity, two callers using different\nlimits share one cache entry -- whichever mounts first wins and later\ncallers silently read the wrong page/size (e.g. a limit:5 dashboard\nwidget poisoning the full recurring list). Key factories now include\nevery param the queryFn sends: monthly-summaries, category-trends,\ntransfer-flows, recurring-transactions, merchant-intelligence,\nnet-worth, fy-summaries, anomalies.","tree":{"sha":"b6ce0a6e934c2c9d26147a447d1c2acbcae51272","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/trees/b6ce0a6e934c2c9d26147a447d1c2acbcae51272"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sagargupta16/ledger-sync/git/commits/9b0f5575cd70026ff51469c3c5eadb254f13d772","verification":{"payload":"tree b6ce0a6e934c2c9d26147a447d1c2acbcae51272\nparent 6e3f08cfeaed6fb5b5dc52e16dbda36bee32d13d\nauthor Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1783839829 +0530\ncommitter Sagar Gupta <sg85207@gmail.com> 1783839829 +0530\n\nfix(hooks): include limit/offset in analyticsV2 query keys\n\nEight useAnalyticsV2 hooks sent limit/offset to the API but omitted them\nfrom the queryKey. With staleTime: Infinity, two callers using different\nlimits share one cache entry -- whichever mounts first wins and later\ncallers silently read the wrong page/size (e.g. a limit:5 dashboard\nwidget poisoning the full recurring list). Key factories now include\nevery param the queryFn sends: monthly-summaries, category-trends,\ntransfer-flows, recurring-transactions, merchant-intelligence,\nnet-worth, fy-summaries, anomalies.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2t7D3iUr2r1Q8vAJ4pVkw1TC68\nv6+ARUPn9/8md9AwsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDZgLOFJudDualjRUi6BQbXVa5lIjH6Z4fgtvdY7oXL5KkOcmST+ktY+x9Bti25Kk+\nx4AqN1ckPHYZ1h5AD5CAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T07:32:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92421383?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sagargupta16","id":92421383,"login":"Sagargupta16","node_id":"U_kgDOBYI9Bw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sagargupta16/orgs