rs/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Project-Land-It/landit-public/commits/bae85dca2c60d86c017354ca0e736dff0250c779/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-09T21:25:49Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-09T21:25:49Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude Code"},"message":"Add Land-It agent profiles and Discord-Taiga integration\n\n## 🎨 Agent Profiles (14 images)\n- Skateboard grunge-themed profile pictures for all 13 agents\n- Unique designs with branding colors, tattoos, and piercings\n- Generated with Pollinations.ai (Flux model)\n- High-resolution PNG format\n- Complete README with agent descriptions\n\n## 🤖 Discord-Taiga Integration\n- Custom avatar support from Taiga user profiles\n- Automatic URL conversion (internal → external)\n- Smart caching to minimize API calls\n- Graceful fallback to default webhook avatar\n- PostgreSQL integration (optional)\n- Comprehensive documentation and examples\n\n## 📚 Documentation\n- Main README.md with Land-It overview\n- Agent profiles README with detailed descriptions\n- Integration README with quick start guide\n- API Reference with function documentation\n- Troubleshooting guide\n- Usage examples with sample scripts\n\n## 🛠️ Files Added\n- discord_logger_with_taiga_avatars.py (396 lines)\n- setup.sh (automated setup script)\n- Integration guide, troubleshooting, API docs\n- 14 agent profile images (PNG)\n- Usage examples and sample workflows\n\n## ✨ Features\n- ✅ Production-ready code\n- ✅ Complete documentation\n- ✅ MIT License\n- ✅ Ready for community use\n\nBuilt with ❤️ by the Land-It team\nGenerated: January 9, 2026\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"941ea8f0fa583011ce6c793eee4418d8597c21ac","url":"ht