Update README with six-phase system (Context, Plan, Setup, Build, Test, Learn)\n- Add docs/phases/ with detailed guidance for each phase\n- Move old phase docs to docs/archived/\n- Split setup/ into configure/ (one-time) and prepare/ (per-feature)\n- Add checkpoints.md for human review guidance\n- Rename templates to match Library naming (spec-template, build-plan-template)\n- Update all skills to reference Library locations and framework phases\n- Add framework phase annotations to each skill\n\nRepository now clearly defines:\n- This repo: Process (skills, templates, guidance)\n- BrainDrive-Library: Content (specs, plans, decisions)\n- BrainDrive-Librarian: Tool (manages Library)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddbf95fbcff5b3a82c4964de463955d317843d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/trees/ddbf95fbcff5b3a82c4964de463955d317843d30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/commits/bf7cc31cfedf5b46bb3b5fe58c2b5c7516a35988","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168016869?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring","id":168016869,"login":"davewaring","node_id":"U_kgDOCgO75Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api