ame":"Dave Waring"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-17T21:16:04Z","email":"dwaring@braindrive.ai","name":"Dave Waring"},"message":"Add comprehensive AI development framework documentation\n\nDefines the six-phase system (Context, Plan, Setup, Build, Test, Learn)\nwith clear repository responsibilities and the flywheel learning model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b73bd39e234ce2c86889626789c0138277b88ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/trees/8b73bd39e234ce2c86889626789c0138277b88ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/commits/890220488dc3a820e85c557debd9cdbf30c1a08d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168016869?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring","id":168016869,"login":"davewaring","node_id":"U_kgDOCgO75Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davewaring","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commit/890220488dc3a820e85c557debd9cdbf30c1a08d","node_id":"C_kwDOQ3Zg39oAKDg5MDIyMDQ4OGRjM2E4MjBlODVjNTU3ZGViZDljZGJmMzBjMWEwOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commit/934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd","sha":"934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd"}],"sha":"890220488dc3a820e85c557debd9cdbf30c1a08d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/890220488dc3a820e85c557debd9cdbf30c1a08d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-14T17:32:34Z","email":"davidwaring@mac.mynetworksettings.com","name":"David Waring"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-14T17:32:34Z","email":"davidwaring@mac.mynetworksettings.com","name":"David Waring"},"message":"Update permissions docs with streamlined configuration\n\n- Add three configuration scopes (user, project, local)\n- Add ''ask'' permission type for commit/push confirmation\n- Add recommended streamlined config for auto-approve files\n- Document Read(**), Edit(**), Write(**), Glob, Grep, Task(*)\n- Update Quick Start to include permissions setup as step 1\n- Update changelog with permission configuration updates\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70a5ee7e89f5c17aafad6624f457f3af3c398530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/trees/70a5ee7e89f5c17aafad6624f457f3af3c398530"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/commits/934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commit/934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd","node_id":"C_kwDOQ3Zg39oAKDkzNGJlZGRkM2Q5M2VmODZjZjc5ZmEyYjM3Mzk2OTE3M2VmMGFkY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commit/a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4","sha":"a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4"}],"sha":"934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/934beddd3d93ef86cf79fa2b373969173ef0adcd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T20:24:40Z","email":"davidwaring@mac.mynetworksettings.com","name":"David Waring"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T20:24:40Z","email":"davidwaring@mac.mynetworksettings.com","name":"David Waring"},"message":"Consolidate workflow from 5 phases to 3 phases, 3 templates to 2\n\nBased on learnings from the AI Installer project (January 2025), this\nconsolidation reduces document drift and provides a single source of truth.\n\nChanges:\n- Consolidated 5 phases into 3: Feature Spec, Planning, Build\n- Consolidated 3 templates into 2: feature-spec-template.md + plan-template.md\n- plan-template.md combines architecture, roadmap, and milestones\n- Added /plan skill to generate consolidated execution plans\n- Updated /milestone-check to work with plan.md format\n- Archived old phase docs and templates for reference\n- Updated README to explain the 2-document approach\n\nThe 2-document approach:\n- feature-spec.md = what/why (for stakeholders)\n- plan.md = how (for engineering)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e678cd9bc4622f911e0127c884f17e6c6f6be970","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/trees/e678cd9bc4622f911e0127c884f17e6c6f6be970"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/commits/a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commit/a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4","node_id":"C_kwDOQ3Zg39oAKGE3ZDM2NGViNTdmNjU0MTY0ZTk5MDhiZDE3YmUwNjczNmY1ZjcwYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commit/956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593","sha":"956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593"}],"sha":"a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/a7d364eb57f654164e9908bd17be06736f5f70c4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-10T19:36:06Z","email":"davidwaring@mac.mynetworksettings.com","name":"David Waring"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-10T19:36:06Z","email":"davidwaring@mac.mynetworksettings.com","name":"David Waring"},"message":"Initial implementation of BrainDrive Claude Code workflow system\n\nPhase documentation:\n- Phase 1: Feature Definition (Interview Process)\n- Phase 2: MVP & Scope Definition\n- Phase 3: Technical Design\n- Phase 4: Milestones & Success Criteria\n- Phase 5: Build Workflows\n\nSkills:\n- /interview - Deep interview using AskUserQuestion\n- /feature-spec - Generate feature specifications\n- /milestone-check - Verify milestone success criteria\n- /retro - Post-feature retrospective for continuous improvement\n\nTemplates:\n- feature-spec-template.md\n- technical-design-template.md\n- milestones-template.md\n\nSetup configs:\n- CLAUDE.md.template - Project configuration template\n- mcp-config.json - Recommended MCP servers\n- permissions.md - Permission configuration guide\n\nContext:\n- braindrive-context.md - Essential BrainDrive context for Claude\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8350f6652f3e31c17b4c71f066472b2960842606","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/trees/8350f6652f3e31c17b4c71f066472b2960842606"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/git/commits/956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commit/956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593","node_id":"C_kwDOQ3Zg39oAKDk1NmJmMzRlMWYyOGFkZWJlZWI4YTI5ZTViOTQxYTQ0ODRhMWY1OTM","parents":[],"sha":"956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits/956bf34e1f28adebeeb8a29e5b941a4484a1f593"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/davewaring/braindrive-claude-workflow/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=2ac995e1b4e89e11f01d0fb0439ade4d36822f08&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A17%3A11.149Z"}');
