130dee5329a77b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/catastro-sp-module-nekazari/commits/d17ed06456b5878d330d510caf130dee5329a77b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/269874148?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/basabot","id":269874148,"login":"basabot","node_id":"U_kgDOEBXz5A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/basabot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/catastro-sp-module-nekazari/commits/4bb48f195d9945091d19c62588e469d34448aa02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T12:52:59Z","email":"g.abrego@proton.me","name":"G.A."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T12:52:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(parcels): route writes through entity-manager core API (#4)\n\nThe cadastral frontend created AgriParcel by writing Orion-LD directly,\nand the backend exposed direct INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE on cadastral_parcels.\nBoth bypass the single source of truth (Orion-LD, written solely by\nentity-manager) and would be blocked by the api-gateway write-enforcement.\n\n- frontend parcelApi.createParcel -> POST /api/entities/parcels (flat JSON);\n  the server owns the URN id, NGSI-LD envelope, @context and dedup.\n- remove dead backend parcel-write endpoints (POST/PUT/DELETE /parcels) that\n  wrote directly to the cadastral_parcels read-model.\n- retire orion_sync.py and the /notify route; the Orion->PostGIS projection is\n  now owned by entity-manager''s projection subscription.\n- reads (list/get/summary/query-by-coordinates/NDVI) are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"04660dbebe73f3a91f9ea8f63303e83139d3c0b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/catastro-sp-module-nekazari/git/trees/04660dbebe73f3a91f9ea8f63303e83139d3c0b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/catastro-sp-module-nekazari/git/commits/4bb48f195d9945091d19c62588e469d34448aa02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/catastro-sp-module-nekazari/commit/4bb48f195d9945091d19c62588e469d34448aa02","node_id":"C_kwDOQ3exUNoAKDRiYjQ4ZjE5NWQ5OTQ1MDkxZDE5YzYyNTg4ZTQ2OWQzNDQ0OGFhMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/catastro-sp-module-nekazari/commit/9c4335e793d0ff4da1cf58901f3f2c4419eddfc1","sha":"9c4335e793d0ff4da1cf58901f3f2c4419eddfc1"